    "All14 CGFX/PICA numeric formats with independent literal expected RGBA bytes and bpp values.",
    "Backward object/name/descriptor relative pointers, distinct object and DICT names, arbitrary name bytes, exactly1024 versus1025-byte names, texture selection and borrowed ownership.",
    "Explicit24x16 shared texture storage cropped to17x9; CGFX requires power-of-two storage. XY palette marker remains BCLIM-only.",
